```

If `self.call` is `p_sync_wrapper`, `_unwrapped_call` is `sync_wrapper_func`.
`iscoroutinefunction(sync_wrapper_func)` is `False`.
`sync_wrapper_func` is not a class.
`dunder_call` is `sync_wrapper_func.__call__`.
`iscoroutinefunction(dunder_call)` is `False`.

So `_unwrapped_call` is not enough because it only unwraps `partial` once.

If we change `_unwrapped_call` to fully unwrap both `partial` and `__wrapped__`, then it would work.

```python
